    "0b6c1a10-0000-4000-8001-000000000007": {
      "name": "It started in a side stream",
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The water did not start in the big river.**\n\nThe bright blue line is the **Lhende Khola**. ICIMOD has the avalanche landing\nin [this stream](https://www.icimod.org/press-release/major-flash-flood-sweeps-through-nepals-rasuwa-district-raising-fears-of-further-downstream-flooding/), which carried the flow to the Bhote Koshi at\n**Timure**, 14 km along. Every distance here is measured from\nits top.\n\n**On the map:** the bright blue line is the Lhende Khola \u00b7 \u26aa Timure, where it joins the Bhote Koshi\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "It started in a side stream"
        },
        "extent": [
          9475126.071394354,
          3262780.582941732,
