    "0b6c1a10-0000-4000-8001-000000000010": {
      "name": "What the flood did in each part of the river",
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**Colour is how steep the riverbed is.**\n\n\ud83d\udd34 **Steep gorge, 0-20 km** \u00b7 42.5 m\nper km \u00b7 a wall, in minutes\n\n\ud83d\udfe0 **Middle valley, 20-60 km**\n\u00b7 24.3 m per km \u00b7 slowing, hemmed in\n\n\ud83d\udfe1 **Open valley, 60 km on** \u00b7 2.6 m\nper km \u00b7 a rise, over hours\n\n**On the map:** \u26aa the places measured to \u00b7 gradient is measured, damage is not\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "What the flood did in each part of the river"
        },
