    "0b6c1a10-0000-4000-8001-000000000011": {
      "name": "When the water reached each place",
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The water took about twenty minutes to reach Timure, and most of a day to\nreach Devghat.**\n\nThe collapse was at **08:37**. ICIMOD has the Bhote Koshi rising\n[around 09:00](https://www.icimod.org/press-release/major-flash-flood-sweeps-through-nepals-rasuwa-district-raising-fears-of-further-downstream-flooding/) at Timure, 14 km down. By Galchhi\nit is **hours**. By Devghat, **the next day**.\n\n*Only the first leg was reported.*\n\n**On the map:** \u26aa the places timed \u00b7 the flood path, reddest where it moved fastest\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "When the water reached each place"
        },
        "extent": [
