    "0b6c1a10-0000-4000-8001-000000000012": {
      "name": "The streams that join it",
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**Another 35 rivers join this one.**\n\nEach adds its own water and debris: the **Kyirong Tsangpo** at km 10, the **Chilime Khola** at km 23, the **Langtang Khola** at km 25.\n\nA surge in the main river also blocks their mouths, so places up a side stream\nflood without that stream being in flood.\n\n**On the map:** the blue lines are the tributaries \u00b7 each joins at its own kilometre down the channel\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "The streams that join it"
        },
        "extent": [
          9359300.040789815,
          3159002.0504857153,
          9620673.13966296,
          3351556.1685385387
        ],
        "layerOverride": [
