    "0b6c1a10-0000-4000-8001-000000000013": {
      "name": "How many people live beside it",
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**About 172,782 people live\nwithin a kilometre of this river. Almost none of them are where it was most\nviolent.**\n\n**1,239** live along the steep\ngorge, where the flood was most violent.\n**156,970** live along the flat lower\nvalley, where it arrived slowly.\n\nTimure (\u091f\u093f\u092e\u0941\u0930\u0947) is at the border crossing.\n\n*Modelled population, not a head count.*\n\n**On the map:** \u26ab settlements OpenStreetMap knows about \u00b7 \u26aa the places measured to\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "How many people live beside it"
        },
        "extent": [
