    "0b6c1a10-0000-4000-8001-000000000017": {
      "name": "What this map does not show",
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**OpenStreetMap has three hydropower plants or dams on this river.**\n\nThe violet marks are all of them. ICIMOD notes [several](https://www.icimod.org/press-release/major-flash-flood-sweeps-through-nepals-rasuwa-district-raising-fears-of-further-downstream-flooding/) along the\nBhote Koshi and the rivers joining it, so three is a floor, not a count.\n\nThe gap is left visible rather than guessed at. [Organised\nmapping](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Organised_Editing/Activities/Nepal_Floods_2026)\nof this valley began within days.\n\n**On the map:** the violet dots are hydropower plants and dams \u00b7 \u26ab settlements\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "What this map does not show"
        },
